  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Roots and vines spring from the earth, cladding your allies in a protective barrier of thorns.</p><p>You and each creature of your choice within a <strong>5-space-radius</strong> of you gains <strong>+1 Armor</strong> until the start of your next turn.</p><p>Additionally, any attacker that hits a creature affected by this spell suffers <strong>1 Damage</strong>.</p><p>Each extra success increases the <strong>Damage</strong> by +<strong>1</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you can choose to extend the duration of the effect by <strong>+1 rounds</strong> per extra success.</p><p>You can also increase the <strong>Armor</strong> granted by <strong>+1</strong> per 2 extra successes.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.saIsuT9RTeOVrDWc]{Shield of Thorns}</p>",
